        <item>
            <title>Version 2.1.18</title>
            <description>
                <![CDATA[
                <h1 id="v2118">v2.1.18</h1>

<h3 id="features">🚀 Features</h3>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>add menu item to remove all history items (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/6f0dd6f775e03559880f6e50a5c70266bf41a6e6">6f0dd6f</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: add “Select” submenu to filter items within the current selection (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/4bde131095fe1e0684afdbb68f5738a1877ea19d">4bde131</a>)</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3 id="bug-fixes">🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>resolve crash on macOS 13.x occurring when the dialog is open (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/f5b97167a3cca52010a6eae274c99adf24bb06eb">f5b9716</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: copies to the correct destination when files use a directory alignment rule (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/9bd41934107a67a1133f2d6686e72f7874a57513">9bd4193</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: correct regexp alignment against directories names (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/aa220da39df02d26de6dafb572fe1180e36013fa">aa220da</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: use shorter menu item text (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/11b01f896a3899cc1870e6dcbed2af6eff62c7ea">11b01f8</a>)</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3 id="performance">✨ Performance</h3>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>File Compare: avoid recomputing line properties in copy/delete loops (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/22e41a37ccab367ba3cc909057c9b5159542cbec">22e41a3</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: resolve linked anchor base in a single pass (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/0449c197ab37ec90ce27ad7f7ec790e386031afd">0449c19</a>)</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Folder Compare: reuse reserved-right lookup during alignment (<a href="https://github.com/visualdiffer/visualdiffer/commit/3ed902547d421590153f2b8929da0cb4e54c7a72">3ed9025</a>)</p>
  </li>
</ul>


                ]]>
